{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to find unique and exclusive content, paranormal streamer Symon stumbles upon an obscure urban legend known only as the &quot;Phantom Incident&quot;. Hardly any information of the event exists besides mentions in a small newspaper and stories from locals. Seeing this as a perfect scoop for his social media, he jumps at the opportunity to bring new light to the story and gain more followers in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Perigee Gas Station, Henderson Estate and surrounding area, solving puzzles and using your resources wisely to move forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Document your journey by filming segments and collecting evidence. The evidence you uncover will determine your understanding at the conclusion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADDITIONAL INFO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice acted (English only).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is roughly 45-60 minutes to complete and has multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shopaholic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3527080/628649112c2480a44688f16252f3ec723a79c6e1.jpg"},{"name":"Cone Crusher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3527080/d80046a710c0666efd00fb260ba768bca05cc038.jpg"},{"name":"Light Bringer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3527080/cb6eca0b90df90faf9dce3be2bd7ad910e132e39.jpg"},{"name":"Real Gamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3527080/be6ae178e89caf078bd5ca83af1091bec114ff20.jpg"}